(7347068, 1148215, 113016, '<td valign="top">she does look exhausted.  for me though, it seems like this may be more a personal story that is not laying itself out to ''the public'' than it should be.  If I allow myself to weave the story, I feel you''re selling your house and handling the finance yourself......which is exhausting.  Good Luck!</td>', 'she does look exhausted.  for me though, it seems like this may be more a personal story that is not laying itself out to ''the public'' than it should be.  If I allow myself to weave the story, I feel you''re selling your house and handling the finance yourself......which is exhausting.  Good Luck!', '2015-05-02 15:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
